  "farming), V17828 (Head's labor income from business), V17831 (Head's bonuses, "
  "overtime and commissions), V17832 (Head's income from professional practice or "
  "trade), V17833 (Head's labor income from market gardening), and V17834 (Head's "
  "labor income from roomers and boarders) if V17835 (accuracy of Head's non-wage "
  'labor income) equaled 1 or 2; V17836 (Wife\'s/"Wife\'s" labor income) if V17837 '
  '(accuracy of Wife\'s/ "Wife\'s" labor income) equaled 1 or 2; V17846 (Head\'s '
  "interest and dividends) and the absolute values of V17838 (Head's and "
  'Wife\'s/"Wife\'s" asset income from farming), V17839 (Head\'s and Wife\'s/"Wife\'s" '
  'asset income from business), V17840 (Head\'s and Wife\'s/"Wife\'s" asset income '
